+# above the felt band. Sat lower, the circlet, the band and the brim stacked into
+# three concentric rings directly above the face-void - the model's cleanest
+# transition turned into its busiest area, and the "worn OVER a hat" story was
+# never told because no bare felt showed beneath the metal. Raising it is also
+# what gives the blades sky behind them instead of brim.
