+# survived. Deepening an aliased feature only aliases harder, which is exactly
+# what the last four attempts observed and misread as "not deep enough".
+#
+# HAT_SPINE_STEPS below is the actual fix. Everything here is now sized in real
+# millimetres and can be trusted to appear.
+CROWN_DENT_FALL = 0.022   # height scale of the squeeze: narrow = a waist
+CROWN_BITE_R    = 0.080   # THE key number. At the contact line the metal simply
+                          # wins: the cloth is forced to the ring's own circular
+                          # radius instead of keeping the hat's oval section. Set
