+                          # CROWN_MINOR = 0.075) so the tube stays buried in felt
+                          # at EVERY azimuth. That is what stops the circlet
+                          # reading as floating hardware, and it is also why the
+                          # crush is uniform: a rigid ring crushing a soft oval
