+#
+# Columns are (angle, height, out, wide, snap):
+#   out  - splay away from the cone, as a fraction of height. NOT a constant-angle
+#          number: CREST_RAKE tips every blade backward about +X, which cancels
+#          splay on the front blades and adds to it on the rear ones, so `out`
+#          has to be solved per azimuth. These four were solved to land at 30, 32,
